# Comparison Theorem, Feynman-Kac Formula and Girsanov Transformation for BSDEs Driven by G-Brownian Motion

**Authors:** Mingshang Hu, Shaolin Ji, Shige Peng, Yongsheng Song

## Summary
In this paper, we study comparison theorem, nonlinear Feynman-Kac formula and Girsanov transformation of the BSDE driven by a G-Brownian motion.


